{
  "_doc": "PLAN-2a-1 / G-MOCK mapping for glass.py cmp (contracts/lab.md section 3). Mockup docs/phase2/mockups/home-apps-home-t1.html data-ids -> live selectors of C2a's T3 nodes (theme/41-home.css header documents the DOM). Run with --flags wp.c2a,wp.p3,wp.c1a,searchCircle: the mockup shows the standard layout (search circle); without searchCircle C1a shows the capsule and Home uses its low layout (HA 3.1.1, rows +40). back and search are C1a's Steam nodes on windowless routes (WN 3.2). The card ids need the card open: the pre focuses cell 3 and waits past the 0.8 s step.",
